{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking place in a tank suspended upon a cosmic wonderland, five axolotls appear one day from a mysterious, thundering void. They quickly learn they are able to speak with one another, and relationships are formed. However, something is off. Each axolotl seems to possess knowledge they should not know. Foods, and people, and places and concepts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And obsessions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid conspiracies, illnesses, fights to the death, VR headsets, and bizarre reality switching, a figure named [RB] seems to be pulling the strings behind it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.poster.avif?t=1741111077\" width=552 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.webm?t=1741111077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.mp4?t=1741111077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Variety is the spice of life, and with RB: Axolotl you never know what to expect! There are more realities out there than just the tank...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Press \u2018S\u2019 at various points in the story to perform the world's greatest somersault!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A meticulously crafted universe full of lore, rewarding detail-oriented players. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Dynamic movements bursting with personality! Each animation is handcrafted with care and love, and no scene looks the same.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Plot twists, revelations, and hefty battle scenes are in store for those who take their first steps into the tank.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A catchy OST by a variety of artists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Written and programmed by one individual. A true passion project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an emotional tale that I built with all the passion and love in my heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite its cute art style,<strong> the visual novel RB: Axolotl is intended for mature audiences only.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/c9eb42fa1402e889204e67a283d2f5a0.avif?t=1741111077\" width=300 height=243 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d661203ba73f26d2e15277790ff4df1156218ecd.jpg","localized_name":"Hiya folks!","name":"Hiya folks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014580/d661203ba73f26d2e15277790ff4df1156218ecd.jpg"},{"icon":"9043402dc1410465f94a05e8352114b9ef15e010.jpg","localized_name":"Take a glimpse into the past","name":"Take a glimpse into the past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014580/9043402dc1410465f94a05e8352114b9ef15e010.jpg"},{"icon":"bc1ebc8f09e9f9f47a33984b1f8e789935bb7c8f.jpg","localized_name":"Bad Ending","name":"Bad Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1014580/bc1ebc8f09e9f9f47a33984b1f8e789935bb7c8f.jpg"},{"icon